#: outputs/on_off_modbus.py:68
msgid ""
"Switch coils on a Modbus TCP device (PLC, relay board, gateway). Each "
"channel is one coil address. After every command the coil is read back to "
"confirm it actually changed, and a mismatch is reported as a failure. Inputs"
" and Outputs pointing at the same host and port share one connection "
"automatically. Note that a readback confirms the PLC register, not that the "
"relay or wiring moved. Modbus has no authentication or encryption — keep the"
" device on an isolated network."
msgstr ""

